# https://docs.github.com/cn/get-started/getting-started-with-git/configuring-git-to-handle-line-endings

# 自动将所有文本文件的换行符规范为 LF。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 声明检出时始终使用 CRLF 换行符的文件。
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.[cC][mM][dD] text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.[bB][aA][tT] text eol=crlf

# 标记真正的二进制文件，避免修改其内容。
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.svg binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary